 from gnews:6b89157155648b9ec317d209 2026-07-08] SambaNova raised $1 billion in financing, led by General Atlantic with Seligman Ventures, T. Rowe Price and Capital Group participating; the round valued it at $11 billion.\\n    Quote: An AI chip startup has raised $1 billion in financing as investors continue to pour money into companies looking to challenge Nvidia .\", \"- e215 [fact; CNBC; original source JPMorgan Chase 2026-07-08; from gnews:6b89157155648b9ec317d209 2026-07-08] JPMorgan Chase said it would deploy SambaNova systems for on-prem inference in its enterprise AI workloads.\\n    Quote: On Wednesday, JPMorgan Chase said it would deploy SambaNova's systems for \\\"on-prem inference in our demanding enterprise AI workloads.\\\"\", \"- e216 [party_statement; SambaNova co-founder and CEO Rodrigo Liang, quoted by CNBC; original source Rodrigo Liang ; from gnews:6b89157155648b9ec317d209 2026-07-08] SambaNova CEO Rodrigo Liang said the new capital would let the company accelerate deployments of racks customers want; he gave no deployment amount or date.\\n    Quote: \\\"We're scaling the business really, really fast, and so the capital allows us to really accelerate the deployments of the racks that customers really want,\\\" he said.\", \"- e217 [third_party_view; tradingview.com; original source Bloomberg-tracked analysts ; from gnews:a09988fd9c5c1a739a14f873 2026-07-08] Bloomberg-tracked analysts project NVIDIA FY2027 profit of $228 billion and sales of $393 billion, up 90% and 82%, respectively; the profit estimate rose 13% over the prior three months.\\n    Quote: company is projected to generate $228 billion in profit on $393 billion in sales in fiscal 2027, which ends Jan. 31, representing expected growth of 90% and 82%, respectively, while its profit estimate has risen 13% over the past three months.\", \"- e218 [third_party_view; tradingview.com; original source Bloomberg Intelligence ; from gnews:a09988fd9c5c1a739a14f873 2026-07-08] Bloomberg Intelligence data cited in the source puts NVIDIA's server GPU market share at 97% at the end of 2025, up from 95% at the end of 2024.\\n    Quote: The company is projected to generate $228 billion in profit on $393 billion in sales in fiscal 2027, which ends Jan. 31, representing expected growth of 90% and 82%, respectively, while its profit estimate has risen 13% over the past three months.\", \"- e219 [third_party_view; Bloomberg, reporting Bloomberg Intelligence’s survey; original source Bloomberg Intelligence survey respondents 2026-07-07; from gnews:f3ba15f5e14b15ee61d7fddc 2026-07-08] Chinese executives surveyed by Bloomberg Intelligence said they plan to allocate 46% of their AI-accelerator budgets to domestic products over the next 12 months, up from 30% currently.\\n    Quote: Executives in the country say they’ll allocate 46% of their budget for artificial intelligence accelerators to domestic products over the next 12 months, up from 30% today, according to a Bloomberg Intelligence survey released on Tuesday.\\n    Opinion, not verified: the matcher read this as the same claim as e157; the argument counts one claim, one more outlet.\", \"- e220 [third_party_view; Bloomberg, reporting Bloomberg Intelligence’s survey; original source Bloomberg Intelligence 2026-07-07; from gnews:f3ba15f5e14b15ee61d7fddc 2026-07-08] Bloomberg Intelligence survey findings indicate Nvidia’s China market share is expected to shrink as H20 chips become harder to find and domestic suppliers gain ground.\\n    Quote: While Nvidia’s products remain popular, the Santa Clara-based firm’s market share is expected to shrink as its H20 chips, which Beijing has urged its tech firms not to use, become harder to find and local firms take over, according to the survey.\\n    Opinion, not verified: the matcher read this as the same claim as e159; the argument counts one claim, one more outlet.\", \"- e221 [third_party_view; Bloomberg, citing Bloomberg News; original source China’s government-led i