om gnews:3df0bbc8aff2c1d008bc0a32 2026-07-06] Some estimates put memory at half of total data-center spending in 2027.\\n    Quote: Some estimates put half of all data center spend going toward memory in 2027.\", \"- e106 [third_party_view; Danielle Liverance; original source Danielle Liverance 2026-07-06; from gnews:3df0bbc8aff2c1d008bc0a32 2026-07-06] The author said NVIDIA had $119 billion in supply commitments, whose value depends on AI delivering measurable economic value beyond productivity tools.\\n    Quote: Nvidia's $119B in supply commitments hinge on AI delivering measurable economic value beyond productivity tools, which is a question the market appears to already be pricing in.\\n    Opinion, not verified: the matcher read this as the same claim as e121; the argument counts one claim, one more outlet.\", \"- e107 [third_party_view; Danielle Liverance; original source Danielle Liverance 2026-07-06; from gnews:3df0bbc8aff2c1d008bc0a32 2026-07-06] The author calculated that NVIDIA traded at a forward price-to-earnings ratio below 20.\\n    Quote: trades at a forward P/E of less than 20 now, and\", \"- e114 [fact; 247wallst.com (Omor Ibne Ehsan); original source NVIDIA ; from gnews:4d1b1ca014068fb532f116b3 2026-07-06] NVIDIA reported Q1 FY2027 revenue of $81.61 billion, up 85.2% year over year.\\n    Quote: Q1 FY27 revenue came in at $81.61 billion, up 85.2% year over year\\n    Opinion, not verified: the matcher read this as the same claim as e98; the argument counts one claim, one more outlet.\", \"- e115 [fact; 247wallst.com (Omor Ibne Ehsan); original source NVIDIA ; from gnews:4d1b1ca014068fb532f116b3 2026-07-06] NVIDIA reported Q1 FY2027 data center revenue of $75.25 billion.\\n    Quote: with data center revenue of $75.25 billion.\\n    Opinion, not verified: the matcher read this as the same claim as e94; the argument counts one claim, one more outlet.\", \"- e116 [third_party_view; 247wallst.com (Omor Ibne Ehsan); original source 247wallst.com (Omor Ibne Ehsan) 2026-07-06; from gnews:4d1b1ca014068fb532f116b3 2026-07-06] The author estimates hyperscalers account for about 50% of NVIDIA's data center revenue.\\n    Quote: About 50% of that data center number comes from hyperscalers\", \"- e117 [party_statement; 247wallst.com (Omor Ibne Ehsan); original source NVIDIA management ; from gnews:4d1b1ca014068fb532f116b3 2026-07-06] NVIDIA management guided Q2 FY2027 revenue to $91.0 billion and non-GAAP gross margin to 75%.\\n    Quote: Management guided Q2 FY27 revenue to $91.0 billion with non-GAAP gross margin holding at 75%.\\n    Opinion, not verified: the matcher read this as the same claim as e96; the argument counts one claim, one more outlet.\", \"- e118 [fact; 247wallst.com (Omor Ibne Ehsan); original source NVIDIA ; from gnews:4d1b1ca014068fb532f116b3 2026-07-06] NVIDIA networking revenue was $14.8 billion in Q1 FY2027, up 199% year over year.\\n    Quote: Networking revenue grew 199% year over year to $14.8 billion\", \"- e119 [fact; 247wallst.com (Omor Ibne Ehsan); original source Amazon ; from gnews:4d1b1ca014068fb532f116b3 2026-07-06] Amazon disclosed that its Trainium business has reached multi-billion-dollar scale.\\n    Quote: Amazon has disclosed Trainium is now a multi-billion-dollar business\", \"- e120 [party_statement; 247wallst.com (Omor Ibne Ehsan); original source Colette Kress, NVIDIA CFO ; from gnews:4d1b1ca014068fb532f116b3 2026-07-06] NVIDIA CFO Colette Kress said the future China data center compute market could be close to $50 billion and that losing it would be material; the author says NVIDIA's China data center compute revenue is effectively zero.\\n    Quote: China data center compute revenue is effectively zero, and Colette Kress (Nvidia’s CFO) said losing that market, which NVIDIA sizes at “close to about $50 billion in the future,” would be material.\", \"- e121 [third_party_view; 247wallst.com (Omor Ibne Ehsan); original source 247wallst.com (Omor Ibne Ehsan) 2026-07-06; from g